          "en": "prisma schema, of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 62.91,
          "end": 66.24,
          "en": "which is not by accident but on purpose.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.24,
          "end": 68.82,
          "en": "So that's what I expect to get here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.82,
          "end": 70.71000000000001,
          "en": "And then in this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.71000000000001,
          "end": 74.403,
          "en": "we now want to use Prisma to create that new expense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 75.33,
          "end": 77.01,
          "en": "Now, for that as a first step",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 77.01,
          "end": 82.01,
          "en": "you should go to your terminal and run npx prisma generate.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 83.64,
          "end": 87.27,
          "en": "Now what this will do is it will create a code bundle",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 87.27,
          "end": 89.85,
          "en": "based on your schema dot prisma file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 89.85,
          "end": 93.179,
          "en": "that makes it very easy to interact with Prisma",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 93.179,
          "end": 94.71000000000001,
          "en": "and your database.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 94.71000000000001,
          "end": 97.28999999999999,
          "en": "And you'll see what I mean in just a second.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 97.28999999999999,
          "end": 99.33,
          "en": "So after running this covant back here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 99.33,
          "end": 103.44,
          "en": "in expenses dot server js, in this add expense function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 103.44,
          "end": 106.68,
          "en": "we now want to use this Prisma database connection",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 106.68,
          "end": 109.77000000000001,
          "en": "which we establish in database dot server js.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 109.77000000000001,
          "end": 112.77000000000001,
          "en": "And for that we simply import prisma",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 112.77000000000001,
          "end": 116.10300000000001,
          "en": "from dot slash database dot server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 117.18,
          "end": 119.91,
          "en": "And then in add expense we can use this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 119.91,
          "end": 121.62,
          "en": "imported prisma object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 121.62,
          "end": 124.74,
          "en": "which in the end is a Prisma object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 124.74,
          "end": 126.88,
          "en": "that has a connection to the database",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 128.34,
          "end": 132.12,
          "en": "to access dot expense dot create",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 132.12,
          "end": 134.22,
          "en": "to create a new expense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 134.22,
          "end": 136.68,
          "en": "And that's why we're using prisma",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 136.68,
          "end": 139.44,
          "en": "because that is the command we have to run",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 139.44,
          "end": 142.5,
          "en": "to add a new expense in the database.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 142.5,
          "end": 145.89,
          "en": "We don't have to write any complex query on our own.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 145.89,
          "end": 149.79,
          "en": "Instead, this will create a new expense in the database.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 149.79,
          "end": 152.64,
          "en": "Well, of course we still have to tell prisma which data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 152.64,
          "end": 155.73,
          "en": "should be included in that expense that is created.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 155.73,
          "end": 159.39,
          "en": "And for that you pass an object to this create method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 159.39,
          "end": 163.68,
          "en": "And in this object you define a data property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 163.68,
          "end": 166.35,
          "en": "which is a never nested object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 166.35,
          "end": 168.87,
          "en": "And this nested object simply now includes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 168.87,
          "end": 170.493,
          "en": "all the data you want to add.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 171.32999999999998,
          "end": 173.55,
          "en": "For example, here you set the title,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 173.55,
          "end": 175.71,
          "en": "and you should get some nice auto completion here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 175.71,
          "end": 178.38,
          "en": "which makes it very convenient to work with prisma.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 178.38,
          "end": 182.13,
          "en": "That's why we ran this npx prisma generate command.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 182.13,
          "end": 185.28,
          "en": "This generated a code bundle that knows about our data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 185.28,
          "end": 187.623,
          "en": "and gives us that useful auto completion.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 188.73,
          "end": 191.85,
          "en": "So here we then add the title property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 191.85,
          "end": 194.79,
          "en": "and we expect to get that on our expense data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 194.79,
          "end": 198.06,
          "en": "There we should be able to access the title property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 198.06,
          "end": 200.7,
          "en": "because this data will be coming from our form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 200.7,
          "end": 204.42000000000002,
          "en": "And in that form we have an input with a name of title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 204.42000000000002,
          "end": 206.85,
          "en": "And these names, as you learned in the Remix",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 206.85,
          "end": 208.743,
          "en": "essential section, will be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 208.743,
          "end": 212.4,
          "en": "to give you access to the data entered by the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 212.4,
          "end": 215.85,
          "en": "So here I have name title, name amount, and name date",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 215.85,
          "end": 219.24,
          "en": "and therefore amount, date and title are the properties",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 219.24,
          "end": 221.553,
          "en": "by which we can access the submitted data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 222.57,
          "end": 224.433,
          "en": "Here we're accessing the title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 225.27,
          "end": 226.74,
          "en": "Then we wanna store the amount",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 226.74,
          "end": 228.993,
          "en": "by accessing expense data dot amount.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 230.1,
          "end": 232.56,
          "en": "However, this should be converted to a number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 232.56,
          "end": 234.6,
          "en": "And for that I'll add a plus in front",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 234.6,
          "end": 236.7,
          "en": "of expense data dot amount.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 236.7,
          "end": 238.53,
          "en": "Because the data you get from a form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 238.53,
          "end": 241.29,
          "en": "will always be a string no matter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 241.29,
          "end": 245.16,
          "en": "if the type on an input is set to number or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 245.16,
          "end": 248.04,
          "en": "This is only relevant for client side validation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 248.04,
          "end": 250.5,
          "en": "and how the input is displayed to the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 250.5,
          "end": 253.56,
          "en": "But the data you get in your code will always be a string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 253.56,
          "end": 256.38,
          "en": "So here we convert it manually to a number then",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 256.38,
          "end": 260.52,
          "en": "because in our prisma model, we expect to get a number",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 260.52,
          "end": 263.463,
          "en": "for the amount, a floating number to be precise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 264.36,
          "end": 267.54,
          "en": "And then last but not least, we have the date.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 267.54,
          "end": 270,
          "en": "And here we'll create a new date object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 270,
          "end": 273.57,
          "en": "with JavaScripts built in date class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 273.57,
          "end": 275.76,
          "en": "And to that constructor we pass",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 275.76,
          "end": 278.31,
          "en": "expense data dot date, which is a date",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 278.31,
          "end": 280.29,
          "en": "but again stored as a string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 280.29,
          "end": 282.42,
          "en": "And here we convert it to a date object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 282.42,
          "end": 284.34000000000003,
          "en": "because that is what prisma expects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 284.34000000000003,
          "end": 286.713,
          "en": "because that is what MongoDB expects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 287.85,
          "end": 289.72,
          "en": "But with that, we're then creating",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 290.717,
          "end": 292.44,
          "en": "a new expense with help of Prisma.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 292.44,
          "end": 295.53,
          "en": "And again, this code will trade a query that's sent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 295.53,
          "end": 298.653,
          "en": "to MongoDB so that the data is stored there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 299.52,
          "end": 302.91,
          "en": "And this will then give us a promise that is done",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 302.91,
          "end": 304.95,
          "en": "once the query is done.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 304.95,
          "end": 307.41,
          "en": "So therefore here we can add a weight in front of it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 307.41,
          "end": 309.72,
          "en": "since I turned it into a async function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 309.72,
          "end": 312.603,
          "en": "to wait for the creation of this expense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 313.98,
          "end": 315.96,
          "en": "And we can then also, if you want to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 315.96,
          "end": 318.9,
          "en": "return the created expense,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 318.9,
          "end": 321.48,
          "en": "because this promise that's returned by a create,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 321.48,
          "end": 324.51,
          "en": "for which we're waiting here, will ultimately resolve",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 324.51,
          "end": 326.403,
          "en": "to the expense that was created.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 327.54,
          "end": 331.41,
          "en": "And I'll wrap this with try catch",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 331.41,
          "end": 333.36,
          "en": "to make sure I catch any errors.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 333.36,
          "end": 336.09000000000003,
          "en": "If the creation fails for some reason",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 336.09000000000003,
          "end": 338.43,
          "en": "then I want to catch the error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 338.43,
          "end": 341.19,
          "en": "And here for the moment I'll just log the error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 341.19,
          "end": 345.48,
          "en": "But soon we'll also add some better error handling here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 345.48,
          "end": 348.39,
          "en": "For the moment I'll just log it and rethrow the error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 348.39,
          "end": 350.49,
          "en": "But as mentioned, we'll soon make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 350.49,
          "end": 353.403,
          "en": "that we do handle errors in a more meaningful way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 354.42,
          "end": 356.94,
          "en": "But with that, we get this add expense function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 356.94,
          "end": 359.31,
          "en": "in this expenses dot server js file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 359.31,
          "end": 362.28,
          "en": "And now we can go back to this add jsx file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 362.28,
          "end": 364.26,
          "en": "and make sure that we call that function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 364.26,
          "end": 366.573,
          "en": "on which we just worked in this action.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
